<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Event-Cal on Rowan Amateur Radio Society</title><link>https://www.rowanars.net/tags/event-cal/</link><description>Recent content in Event-Cal on Rowan Amateur Radio Society</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 26 Jul 2027 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.rowanars.net/tags/event-cal/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Field Day 2027</title><link>https://www.rowanars.net/events/field-day-2027/</link><pubDate>Sun, 12 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.rowanars.net/events/field-day-2027/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;This page is still under development. As June 2027 approaches, please re-visit for new updates. Thank you!&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="rars-2027-field-day" id=rars-2027-field-day&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span class="me-2"&gt;RARS 2027 Field Day&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#rars-2027-field-day" class="anchor text-muted"&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-hashtag"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Rowan ARS Field Day is excited about 2027&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="celebrating-the-power-and-possibility-of-ham-radio" id=celebrating-the-power-and-possibility-of-ham-radio&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span class="me-2"&gt;Celebrating the Power and Possibility of Ham Radio&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#celebrating-the-power-and-possibility-of-ham-radio" class="anchor text-muted"&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-hashtag"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join the Rowan Amateur Radio Society for &lt;strong&gt;ARRL Field Day 2027&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;ndash; a full weekend dedicated to the art and science of amateur radio. Field Day is amateur radio&amp;rsquo;s largest on-air event, bringing together radio amateurs, hobbyists, students, and curious newcomers to set up stations, make contacts across the country, and demonstrate how hams communicate when traditional infrastructure is unavailable.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Firecracker Hamfest 2027</title><link>https://www.rowanars.net/events/firecracker-hamfest-2027/</link><pubDate>Sun, 12 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.rowanars.net/events/firecracker-hamfest-2027/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;This page is still under development. As July 2027 approaches, please re-visit for new updates. Thank you!&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="firecracker-hamfest-2027" id=firecracker-hamfest-2027&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span class="me-2"&gt;Firecracker Hamfest 2027&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#firecracker-hamfest-2027" class="anchor text-muted"&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-hashtag"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us for the annual Firecracker Hamfest! This popular event brings together amateur radio operators from across the region for a weekend of buying, selling, trading, and socializing.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="event-schedule" id=event-schedule&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span class="me-2"&gt;Event Schedule&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#event-schedule" class="anchor text-muted"&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-hashtag"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="friday-july-9--setup-day" id=friday-july-9--setup-day&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span class="me-2"&gt;Friday, July 9 &amp;ndash; Setup Day&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#friday-july-9--setup-day" class="anchor text-muted"&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-hashtag"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;!--&#10;- **Setup:** 12:00 PM - 5:00 PM&#10;--&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="saturday-july-10--hamfest-day" id=saturday-july-10--hamfest-day&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span class="me-2"&gt;Saturday, July 10 &amp;ndash; Hamfest Day&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#saturday-july-10--hamfest-day" class="anchor text-muted"&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-hashtag"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;!--&#10;- **Vendor Setup:** 6:00 AM&#10;- **Doors Open:** 8:00 AM&#10;- **VE Testing:** 10:00 AM&#10;- **Official Close:** 1:00 PM&#10;--&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="location" id=location&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span class="me-2"&gt;Location&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#location" class="anchor text-muted"&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-hashtag"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;As of 7/2026, we expect to hold the 2027 event at the &lt;em&gt;Salisbury Civic Center&lt;/em&gt;, at least until further notice.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Firecracker Hamfest 2026</title><link>https://www.rowanars.net/posts/firecracker-hamfest-2026/</link><pubDate>Fri, 10 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.rowanars.net/posts/firecracker-hamfest-2026/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="firecracker-hamfest-2026" id=firecracker-hamfest-2026&gt;&#10; Firecracker Hamfest 2026&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual Firecracker Hamfest of 2026 is a popular event bringing together amateur radio operators from across the region for a weekend of buying, selling, trading, and socializing.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="event-schedule" id=event-schedule&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span class="me-2"&gt;Event Schedule&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#event-schedule" class="anchor text-muted"&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-hashtag"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="friday-july-10-2026--setup-day" id=friday-july-10-2026--setup-day&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span class="me-2"&gt;Friday, July 10, 2026 &amp;ndash; Setup Day&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#friday-july-10-2026--setup-day" class="anchor text-muted"&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-hashtag"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Setup:&lt;/strong&gt; 12:00 PM - 5:00 PM&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="saturday-july-11-2026--hamfest-day" id=saturday-july-11-2026--hamfest-day&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span class="me-2"&gt;Saturday, July 11, 2026 &amp;ndash; Hamfest Day&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#saturday-july-11-2026--hamfest-day" class="anchor text-muted"&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-hashtag"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor Setup:&lt;/strong&gt; 6:00 AM&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Doors Open:&lt;/strong&gt; 8:00 AM&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VE Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; 10:00 AM&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Official Close:&lt;/strong&gt; 1:00 PM&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="location" id=location&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span class="me-2"&gt;Location&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#location" class="anchor text-muted"&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-hashtag"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salisbury Civic Center&lt;/strong&gt;&#10;315 S. Martin Luther King Ave&#10;Salisbury, NC&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>